      <room>H.1302</room>
      <slug></slug>
      <title>ZYpp your distro</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>CrossDistro devroom</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;ZYpp is an opensource project originated in the openSUSE distribution which groups the most advanced and fast dependency solver (satsolver), a package management library and a command line package management tool (zypper). Over the years ZYpp has matured to become one of openSUSE most appreciated features.&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This talk will show ZYpp&amp;#39;s main features and work being done to have it running on other rpm-based distributions.&lt;/p&gt;      </description>
      <persons>
          <person id="851">Dominik Heidler</person>
          <person id="852">Duncan Mac-Vicar P.</person>
      </persons>
      <links></links>
      <video></video>
      <end></end>
  </event>